table drumaccent 512 4806 256 ; Accent-Sequenzen
seq drumaccent ~1640 16 ; Drum Accent Steps
seq synthaccent ~1658 16 ; Synth Accent Steps

# Song-Tabelle (EMiX): 64 x 528 Byte ab 0x130000
table song 0x130000 528 64 ; Song (1..64)
field name ~0 ascii 8 ; Name
field tempo_bpm ~8 u16be @7:9 20 300 ; Tempo (BPM ganz)
field tempo_dec ~8 u16be @0:4 0 9 ; Tempo (Dezimalstelle)
field length ~11 u8 0 255 ; Länge
field mute_hold ~12 u8 0=Off 1=On ; Mute Hold
field next_song ~13 u8 0 255 ; Next Song
field events ~14 u16be 0 20000 ; Anzahl Events (nur lesen empfohlen)

# FX (EMX-Pascal-Editor: FXbase 1674, 3 x 4 Byte)
table fx1 2186 4806 256 ; FX 1
field type ~0 u8 0 15 ; Effect Type
field edit1 ~1 u8 0 127 ; Edit 1
field edit2 ~2 u8 0 127 ; Edit 2
field motion ~3 u8 0=Off 1=On ; Motion Seq
table fx2 2190 4806 256 ; FX 2
field type ~0 u8 0 15 ; Effect Type
field edit1 ~1 u8 0 127 ; Edit 1
field edit2 ~2 u8 0 127 ; Edit 2
field motion ~3 u8 0=Off 1=On ; Motion Seq
table fx3 2194 4806 256 ; FX 3
field type ~0 u8 0 15 ; Effect Type
field edit1 ~1 u8 0 127 ; Edit 1
field edit2 ~2 u8 0 127 ; Edit 2
field motion ~3 u8 0=Off 1=On ; Motion Seq

# Synth-Part = 20 Byte Kopf + 128 Noten + 128 Gates (276 Byte, analog ESX-Keyboard). Abgeleitet, an 4 echten EMX-Bänken plausibilisiert (Noten 0x3C / Off 0xBC, Gates 02).
table synthseq1 770 4806 256 ; Synth 1 Sequenz
arr notes ~20 128 0 255 ; Noten pro Step
arr gates ~148 128 0 255 ; Gates pro Step
table synthseq2 1046 4806 256 ; Synth 2 Sequenz
arr notes ~20 128 0 255 ; Noten pro Step
arr gates ~148 128 0 255 ; Gates pro Step
table synthseq3 1322 4806 256 ; Synth 3 Sequenz
arr notes ~20 128 0 255 ; Noten pro Step
arr gates ~148 128 0 255 ; Gates pro Step
table synthseq4 1598 4806 256 ; Synth 4 Sequenz
arr notes ~20 128 0 255 ; Noten pro Step
arr gates ~148 128 0 255 ; Gates pro Step
table synthseq5 1874 4806 256 ; Synth 5 Sequenz
arr notes ~20 128 0 255 ; Noten pro Step
arr gates ~148 128 0 255 ; Gates pro Step

# Motion = 24 x 130 Byte ab Pattern+1686 (1686+3120 = 4806 = Patterngröße). An 4 echten EMX-Bänken plausibilisiert (~95 % Slots = 0xFFFF unbenutzt).
table motion1 2198 4806 256 ; Motion 1
field op ~0 u16be 0 65535 ; Operation-Nr.
arr values ~2 128 0 255 ; Werte (MSB=Off)
table motion2 2328 4806 256 ; Motion 2
field op ~0 u16be 0 65535 ; Operation-Nr.
arr values ~2 128 0 255 ; Werte (MSB=Off)
